Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:30:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Run the interactive rebase and iterative committing scenarios
 with CLI agents

Adds CLI prompts for the two file-commit-chain scenarios, a client for the Evaluator's LLM judge, an oracle and the hiding of the original commits. The incoming parent of a merge is kept under refs/scenario/incoming.
